1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,422
Speaking, task three. Story number 5: Birthday. What did Marie do yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:13,263
What did Marie do yesterday?

3
00:00:33,967 --> 00:00:36,500
Yesterday it was Marie's birthday.

4
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:41,221
In the morning she got up early and baked a chocolate cake in the kitchen.

5
00:00:41,433 --> 00:00:44,267
The cake was big and smelled wonderful.

6
00:00:44,467 --> 00:00:47,456
She put strawberries and whipped cream on the cake.

7
00:00:47,667 --> 00:00:49,900
In the afternoon she decorated the flat.

8
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:53,267
She put colourful balloons in the living room.

9
00:00:53,467 --> 00:00:56,300
Then she prepared food and drinks.

10
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,850
In the evening her friends came.

11
00:00:59,067 --> 00:01:02,021
They brought Marie presents and flowers.

12
00:01:02,233 --> 00:01:04,630
Marie was very happy.

13
00:01:04,833 --> 00:01:08,800
Then everyone ate cake, sang and danced.

14
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,591
The party didn't end until midnight and everyone had a great time.

15
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:23,836
Tell story 5 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
